        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "This day continues the programme for days 4–7. The expedition team selects landing sites according to navigation conditions. One possible stop is Danco Island, where gentoo penguins nest. Weddell and crabeater seals are found in the surrounding waters. The team will confirm on board whether you can visit the island on day 5."
